# shell: desktop
# PVS-050: a drag held in the band at the list's edge scrolls it, after a
# hold delay.  Both halves matter, so both are checked against their own
# negative: the middle of the list never scrolls however long you hold, and
# the band does not scroll until the delay has passed.
press 200 97
move 200 120
note the middle of the list is not a scroll zone, however long it is held
move 200 200
wait 45
expect-scroll-at-most 0
note entering the band does not scroll at once -- crossing an edge on the
note way somewhere else must not start it
move 200 316
wait 5
expect-scroll-at-most 0
note but holding there past the delay does
wait 45
expect-scroll 1
release 200 316
quit
